        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 8\" x 16\" Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nExtra wide solid brass push plate.  8\" wide x 16\" high door push plate. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and factories these wide push plates are made of .050\" thick, high quality solid bronze with oil rubbed bronze finish. Packaged with mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/8-x-16-polished-brass-push-plate\"><b>8\" x 16\" Brass Push Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/8-x-16-stainless-steel-push-plate\"><b>8\" x 16\" Stainless Steel Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese extra wide push plates are made in the USA by Don-Jo Mfg.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 73-613 Oil Rubbed Bronze Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
